py7 is a text with value "with open(\"notes.txt\", \"w\") as f:\n    f.write(\"hi\")\nwith open(\"notes.txt\") as f:\n    content = f.read()\nprint(content)", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable false
py7label is a text with value "Python", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#b7c4d8"
py7copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#22375a", foreground "#e5edf8", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
