b33 is a text with value "Controls are created, given properties, put in a window and shown. when attaches what happens on a click. The same program compiles into a web page with otter web.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b34 is a text with value "Words that differ", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b35 is a text with value "print is say. = is is, and == in a condition is also is. def is to. else is otherwise. A dictionary is a thing with properties. x.name is name of x. len(x) is length of x. list.append(v) is add v to list. An indented block ends with a period on its own line. None is gone.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b36 is a link with text "Your first program", url "/first-program/", foreground "#2563eb", weight 600, size 15
b37 is a link with text "The language guide", url "/values/", foreground "#2563eb", weight 600, size 15

